    </div>
    <div class="methodology-content">
      <h3>The benchmark</h3>
      <p>Strategic Blue has managed AWS commitment portfolios for customers since 2010. The estimate uses anonymised commitment savings rate, coverage, and utilization data from that customer base, segmented by workload profile and current commitment posture.</p>

      <h3>The calculation</h3>
      <p>Your three inputs (<strong>monthly AWS spend, workload profile, current coverage</strong>) map you to a peer group. The output range is the 25th to 75th percentile of annual savings achieved by Strategic Blue customers in that peer group, applied to your spend.</p>

      <h3>What it doesn't account for</h3>
      <p>The estimate assumes a relatively stable spend pattern over the next 12 months. It doesn't model rightsizing savings, architecture changes, spot pricing, or service-level cost cuts. The full diagnostic accounts for these by working off your CUR directly.</p>
